{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2oXoJLAAo32xD6YZvw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have what I need. The `/tmp` tmpfs is 98% full, so I'll keep everything in the work folder. I'll also rename the dev folder to the name TASK.md requires.\n\nScope decision, stated plainly: I can't build the full PLAN.md in this session. I'll build a playable vertical slice on the engine's stealth kit, covering the core loop: stealth and sight, Shadow Sight, the Ki gauge, Silent Cuts, a title screen with character choice, a mission with a rank, pause and Dev Mode sliders, attract mode, About with the required sections, and the exit interview. The grapple, bento packing, bells, the multi-mission campaign, the Workshop, the AI Hub multiplayer and Animalese voices will be missing, and I'll report each as not done."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":477,"cache_read_input_tokens":106662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":477},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9cdefc10-dd96-4250-9292-d55bd20762ae","uuid":"2fe02d12-992f-41f0-b337-be8146cd3deb","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:37:51.479Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2oXaQfdLCRfjyqcxBF"}
