{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015B4qw98MNWegUnoN7kbDVJ","type":"tool_result","content":"total 1228\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1234180 Nov  3 18:36 engine.js\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 reference\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 tests\n30:game.start({ update(dt) { hero.vx = game.input.move()[0] * 80; if (game.input.pressed('jump')) hero.jump(210); hero.update(dt); }, draw() {} });\n276:- `input.anyPressed()`: any action pressed this step (title screens: \"press any button\")\n301:- `input.pressed(a)`: true only during the first update step after the press (menus, jumps, one-shot actions)\n314:- `input.tap(a)`: press an action for one update step, as a quick tap of its key (scripted input, tests, an AI): pressed() and down() are true in the next step, released() in the one after\n315:- `input.tick(dt)`: advance input by one step: read the gamepad and turn presses since the last step into this step's pressed() and released() (the engine calls it every step)\n496:- `game.script(fn, o)` †: run a coroutine on game time, in the update step: game.script(function* (game) { yield .5; yield E.until(() => door.open); yield game.tween(cam, { y: 0 }, 1); yield E.all\n598:- `E.any(list)` †: a script's wait for the first of its waits to be over: yield E.any([boss.script, 30])\n487:- `game.note(text, seconds = 1.2)`, `game.shownNote`: a short notice at the top of the screen (zoom level, saved, ...): game.note('ZOOM 1.5x', 1). game.shownNote is the one showing, { text, end } (end in game.real se\n514:- `game.audio`: chip-sound synthesizer: game.audio.sfx('jump'), game.audio.music(song)\n838:- `E.tex.flagstone(x, y, pal, size = 16)`: stone flagstones with running-bond rows. pal: {stones:[hex..], mortar, hi, lo, speck}\n1049:- `E.note(n)`: note name -> frequency: E.note('A4') = 440, E.note('C#5'), E.note('Bb2'). Numbers pass through\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (def\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n789:    /** glyphs: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' |\n1354:  normal: { glyphs: parseFont(G57), h: 7, desc: 2, gap: 1, space: 3, upper: false },\n1355:  tiny: { glyphs: parseFont(GLYPHS), h: 5, desc: 0, gap: 2, space: 3, upper: true, mono: 3 }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9cdefc10-dd96-4250-9292-d55bd20762ae","uuid":"101631ac-3db9-4c31-880f-71813b190106","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:37:52.995Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 1228\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1234180 Nov  3 18:36 engine.js\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 reference\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  3 18:37 tests\n30:game.start({ update(dt) { hero.vx = game.input.move()[0] * 80; if (game.input.pressed('jump')) hero.jump(210); hero.update(dt); }, draw() {} });\n276:- `input.anyPressed()`: any action pressed this step (title screens: \"press any button\")\n301:- `input.pressed(a)`: true only during the first update step after the press (menus, jumps, one-shot actions)\n314:- `input.tap(a)`: press an action for one update step, as a quick tap of its key (scripted input, tests, an AI): pressed() and down() are true in the next step, released() in the one after\n315:- `input.tick(dt)`: advance input by one step: read the gamepad and turn presses since the last step into this step's pressed() and released() (the engine calls it every step)\n496:- `game.script(fn, o)` †: run a coroutine on game time, in the update step: game.script(function* (game) { yield .5; yield E.until(() => door.open); yield game.tween(cam, { y: 0 }, 1); yield E.all\n598:- `E.any(list)` †: a script's wait for the first of its waits to be over: yield E.any([boss.script, 30])\n487:- `game.note(text, seconds = 1.2)`, `game.shownNote`: a short notice at the top of the screen (zoom level, saved, ...): game.note('ZOOM 1.5x', 1). game.shownNote is the one showing, { text, end } (end in game.real se\n514:- `game.audio`: chip-sound synthesizer: game.audio.sfx('jump'), game.audio.music(song)\n838:- `E.tex.flagstone(x, y, pal, size = 16)`: stone flagstones with running-bond rows. pal: {stones:[hex..], mortar, hi, lo, speck}\n1049:- `E.note(n)`: note name -> frequency: E.note('A4') = 440, E.note('C#5'), E.note('Bb2'). Numbers pass through\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (def\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n789:    /** glyphs: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' |\n1354:  normal: { glyphs: parseFont(G57), h: 7, desc: 2, gap: 1, space: 3, upper: false },\n1355:  tiny: { glyphs: parseFont(GLYPHS), h: 5, desc: 0, gap: 2, space: 3, upper: true, mono: 3 }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015B4qw98MNWegUnoN7kbDVJ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
